    "body": "faulthandler now detects if a frame or a code object is invalid or\nfreed.\n\nAdd helper functions:\n\n* _PyCode_SafeAddr2Line()\n* _PyFrame_SafeGetCode()\n* _PyFrame_SafeGetLasti()\n\n_PyMem_IsPtrFreed() now detects pointers in [-0xff, 0xff] range\nas freed.\n(cherry picked from commit a84181c31bfc45a1d6bcb1296bd298ad612c54d0)\n\nCo-authored-by: Victor Stinner <vstinner@python.org>\n\n<!-- gh-issue-number: gh-140815 -->\n* Issue: gh-140815\n<!-- /gh-issue-number -->\n",
